Navigation\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"page page-reviews\"><div class=\"\"><header class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Client feedback</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">525+ five-star reviews</h2></header></div><div class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"\"><p>Over the years, clients have shared more than 525 five-star reviews on platforms including Zillow and Google. They talk about our responsiveness, market knowledge, and how we make complex transactions feel manageable.</p><p>We’ll be highlighting a selection of those reviews here. For now, this space is reserved as a dedicated hub for the stories our clients have shared.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"reviews-placeholder\"><p>Review carousel and featured quotes will be added here using actual client feedback from Zillow, Google, and other platforms.</p></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"site-logo\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></div><p>Three-generation Fox Cities real estate team with a RealTrends verified record and 525+ five-star reviews.</p></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><p>Diane Lathrop · (920) 428-9227 · diane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Shane Lathrop · (920) 428-0066 · shane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Oliver Lathrop · (920) 858-4424 